& [Purpose]
  + compose a valid Slice2 attention_procedure CandidateCompilationPlan and TypedSopIr with one already normalized ProcedureCandidate
  + prove exact semantic-node to procedure SOP-anchor correspondence before calling the existing effectless CPPE compiler
  + retain the existing validation receipt compiler receipt Process IR and CompiledProcedureIdentity without reclassifying them as verified admitted installed or invoked

& [InputContract]
  + exact valid SopSeed TypedSopIr and CandidateCompilationPlan are supplied separately and replay-validated
  + plan backend and profile must be the seed's exact attention_procedure registration
  + AttentionProcedureBackendRequest binds plan IR candidate validation receipt semantic-node-to-procedure-anchor map and fixed non-authority
  + candidate purpose equals plan purpose candidate provenance cites plan and IR and candidate source is normalized machine form rather than text
  + passed ValidationReceipt validator belongs to plan verifier_refs and its evidence cites plan and IR

& [AnchorCorrespondence]
  + every TypedSopIr node maps exactly once to a distinct ProcedureCandidate SopAnchorBinding
  + binding artifact identity version and digest equal the node SemanticAddress package identity version and digest
  + binding clause identity equals one exact source anchor clause identity from that address
  + extra candidate SOP anchors are explicit unresolved or refuse; no implicit semantic address synthesis occurs

& [EffectBoundary]
  + request capabilities are limited to semantic_read and source_read for this pure projection
  + ProcedureCandidate effect class must be pure and its prohibited-operation wall remains complete under existing procedure validation
  + compile_procedure_candidate may return CPPE Process IR CompiledProcedureIdentity and CompilationReceipt only
  + verification Observer admission catalogue insertion invocation coordination attention loading model calls and all external effects remain outside this slice

& [OutputContract]
  + AttentionProcedureBackendProjection binds seed plan semantic IR candidate validation receipt CPPE compilation outcome unresolved account non-authority and domain-separated digest
  + a passed compilation must contain both Process IR and CompiledProcedureIdentity and a refusal contains neither
  + output is an artifact candidate record only and never a loaded attention procedure

& [Acceptance]
  + equal seed plan IR candidate receipt and mapping yield byte-identical backend projection
  + backend substitution plan or IR drift address anchor clause package version digest purpose provenance validator evidence capability effect and output tampering fail closed
  + existing CPPE compiler tests remain byte and behavior compatible
  + focused debug optimized release complete workspace warnings-denied Clippy format evidence and diff gates pass

